---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="關於希望" description="認識台中希望教會——我們的牧者、歷史、使命與核心價值">

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <div class="bg-hope-green-light border-b border-green-100">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">關於希望</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-gray-600">認識台中希望教會</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 space-y-20">

    <!-- 核心信念 -->
    <section>
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">我們相信</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-lg">
          <p>
            台中希望教會，我們是一個充滿活力與希望、愛的教會。相信每個人的生命都是獨特且美麗的，
            神愛世人的大愛使我們的生命更加豐盛，每個生命都像花草樹木一樣，在陽光雨露中不斷成長。
          </p>
          <p>
            我們是一個家，每一個來到的人都是家人，彼此相愛、一起成長，在神的愛裡找到真正的歸屬。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 聖經節 -->
    <section class="bg-hope-green rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-12 text-center">
      <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-white leading-relaxed">
        「你們要聖潔，<br />因為我耶和華你們的神是聖潔的。」
      </p>
      <cite class="mt-4 block text-green-200 not-italic">利未記 19：2</cite>
    </section>

    <!-- 牧者介紹 -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">我們的牧者</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-hope-green rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold flex-shrink-0">
              林
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">林德松 牧師</h3>
              <p class="text-hope-green text-sm font-medium">主任牧師</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed italic border-l-4 border-hope-green pl-4">
            「宣揚神的國度，使萬人以基督信仰改善生命與品格，影響家庭，進而造就社會。」
          </blockquote>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-hope-green rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-2xl font-bold flex-shrink-0">
              陳
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">陳燕惠 師母</h3>
              <p class="text-hope-green text-sm font-medium">師母</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed italic border-l-4 border-hope-green pl-4">
            「成為每一個家庭的祝福，讓愛的力量在每個角落流動。」
          </blockquote>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 使命與異象 -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">使命與異象</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-hope-green-light rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-hope-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4.354a4 4 0 110 5.292M15 21H3v-1a6 6 0 0112 0v1zm0 0h6v-1a6 6 0 00-9-5.197M13 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">宣揚神的國度</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">用基督信仰改善每個生命，讓更多人認識上帝的愛</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-hope-green-light rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-hope-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">影響家庭</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">從個人到家庭，讓每個家庭都充滿神的祝福與平安</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-xl">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-hope-green-light rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-hope-green" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">造就社會</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">讓信仰的力量成為社會良善的基石，造福台中這座城市</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 聯絡資訊 -->
    <section class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">來找我們</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-hope-green mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">地址</p>
              <p class="text-gray-600">台中市南區工學北路169號</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-hope-green mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.948V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">幸福專線</p>
              <a href="tel:0422651572" class="text-hope-green">(04) 2265-1572</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-hope-green mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">電子信箱</p>
              <a href="mailto:17gohope@gmail.com" class="text-hope-green">17gohope@gmail.com</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-hope-green mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <p class="font-medium text-gray-900">服務時間</p>
              <p class="text-gray-600">週一至週五　AM 09:00 – PM 17:30</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-200 rounded-xl h-48 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 text-sm">
          地圖嵌入位置<br /><span class="text-xs">（可嵌入 Google Maps iframe）</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>
